#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_XplanetGlare)
#: kstars.kcfg:1045 xplanet/opsxplanet.ui:257
msgid ""
"Draw a glare around the sun with a radius of the specified value larger than "
