#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (XplanetBackground), group (Xplanet)
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_XplanetBackground)
#: kstars.kcfg:1084 xplanet/opsxplanet.ui:897
msgid "Use background"
